WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.530
A man named Lazarus has died,
and his sisters are grieving.

2
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.250
In John's Gospel, the stone is taken away,

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.270
and Lazarus walks out of the tomb alive.

4
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.190
Yet one day Lazarus would die again.

5
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.430
So was that really life after
death, or something else?

6
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.860
So when someone dies, what do the
world's religions say happens next,

7
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.320
and does it change how people live?

8
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.720
In this mission, you'll explore judgement,

9
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.510
heaven and hell, and what
Christians mean by resurrection.

10
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.820
Then you'll weigh a big claim: does hope
of an afterlife make this life matter

11
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:36.930
more?

12
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:40.790
Your mission: find out what different
religions teach about death,

13
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.920
and how it shapes the way people live.
